{"unit_id":"Neo65536-engineer__dsh-agent-log#card-zh","repo":"Neo65536-engineer/dsh-agent-log","commit":"50fd116d04ffcfd202ef31d4ec4d2dca203bf603","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-log 是面向 DSH Web 的会话工作报告插件，也提供离线命令行工具。它在 DSH 注册 work_report agent 工具和报告 HTTP 路由，并在右侧侧栏加入可选会话的报告面板。报告汇总任务提示、工具调用、命令、文件读写、测试结果、失败、Token 用量和完成状态；可输出 Markdown、JSON 或可打印 HTML，也能按日期聚合多个会话生成日报周报。适合需要回顾 agent 工作过程、统计用量或排查任务结果的 DSH 用户。插件从本地 DSH 会话日志读取数据，不需要 API key；需要能访问 DSH home。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:220-250","index.js:405-455","client.js:210-245","bin/worklog.mjs:90-105"]}
{"unit_id":"Neo65536-engineer__dsh-agent-log#card-en","repo":"Neo65536-engineer/dsh-agent-log","commit":"50fd116d04ffcfd202ef31d4ec4d2dca203bf603","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-log creates reports from DSH sessions. It registers the work_report tool and a sidebar viewer. Reports summarize tools, commands, files, tests, failures, and token usage; export Markdown, JSON, or HTML; and aggregate sessions by date. It needs local DSH home access and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:220-250","index.js:405-455","client.js:210-245","bin/worklog.mjs:90-105"]}
